    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Hi-ho! Wanna play elevens? We'll give ye a treasure if ye win!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Here goes!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: On my mother's bones, no way this rolls an 11...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: A 9! Yer turn.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: On me mother's bones, no way this rolls an 11...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Yar, the tide be shaking the dice again!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Now don't go tampering with me dice. If I see you touch them, you'll
        walk the plank!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: Glad I could win a game for once. Last one was ruined by that earthquake.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[4].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: I don't know why ye keep rolling matey, yer already a winner!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[4].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: What. Whadya mean ye roll aint finished.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[4].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: Glad I could win a game for once. Last one was ruined by that earthquake.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[5].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Argh, a 7! Better luck next time matey.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[5].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: What. Whadya mean ye roll aint finished.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[6].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Shiver me timbers! How did that happen?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[6].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Arrrr ye be a speedy one. Here's ye prize.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[6].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: Glad I could win a game for once. Last one was ruined by that earthquake.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[7].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: 'What in the name of Davy Jones? How''d ye get an 11? Didn''t even see
        ye roll! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[7].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Arrrr ye be a speedy one. Here's ye prize.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[7].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: Glad I could win a game for once. Last one was ruined by that earthquake.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[8].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: 'What in the name of Davy Jones? How''d ye get an 11? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[8].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: I didn't see any cheats, so here's yer prize.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[9].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Yar... elevens be no fun, I keep losing!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
