    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: characterName
      value: TavernKeep
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].name
      value: 0. Greeting land grubber!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].name
      value: 1. Come back when you're equipped.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].name
      value: 2. Well, what do we have here?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].name
      value: 3. Bring me anything you find.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[4].name
      value: 4. What's The Veil like?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[5].name
      value: 5. Really making a name for yourself, huh?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[6].name
      value: 6. <var>Cat</var>? Heard they might be east of here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[7].name
      value: 7. Just gotta put it all together.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[8].name
      value: 8. Legend.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[9].name
      value: 9. Say hi to <var>Cat</var> for me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogue
