    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].name
      value: 0. I really need to cast this storm spell... but I keep falling off
        this rock!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].name
      value: 1. This time for sure!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].name
      value: 2. Nyeh, failure again!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].name
      value: 3. Agh I'll never get this storm magic right!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[4].name
      value: 4. I got it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[5].name
      value: 5. *sigh*
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[6].name
      value: 6. Ouch, probably should have hopped off that rock.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[7].name
      value: '7. None of the spells I''ve learned are strong enough... they''re all
