    - target: {fileID: 1390625317152906191, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogues.Array.data[0]
      value: "Help! My buoys have gotten tangled up. If only I hadn\u2019t lost the
        E button on my keyboard!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1390625317152906191, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogues.Array.data[1]
      value: Thank you so much! I was in a real knot there..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1390625317152906191, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogues.Array.data[2]
      value: Much appreciated. Now off to find that idiot Pierre.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1390625317152906191, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogues.Array.data[3]
      value: That buffoon thought I left him. He is hopeless.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
