      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].name
      value: 0. All of this rotation nonsense has got my buoys tangled up again
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].name
      value: 1. Hazzah!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].name
      value: 2. Mind spreading out my buoys again?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].name
      value: 3. Want me to enable the buoys?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[4].name
      value: "4. Don\u2019t have much to give, but this was my finest catch of the
        day."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[5].name
      value: 5. Thanks again pal, one day I'll teach you how to fish.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[6].name
      value: "6. What\u2019s up Big Tuna?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
