    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: All of this rotation nonsense has got my buoys tangled up again
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Here, see for yourself
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Hazzah!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Well would you look at that, looks like the tide has pushed everything
        back in place!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: Don't have much to give, but this was my finest catch of the day.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: "Don\u2019t have much to give, but this was my finest catch of the day."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Mind spreading out my buoys again?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Oh you want me to turn them off?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: Alright then.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Want me to enable the buoys?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: There we go.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: "Don\u2019t have much to give, but this was my finest catch of the day."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
