    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: My old man left to explore the foggy seas. His FINAL words to me were
        <wavy>"North then West."</wavy>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: So inpirational. I wonder when he'll come back.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: 'He told me not to search for him cause my "memory sucks." '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: You know what his final words were? <wavy>"North then West."</wavy>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Uh, yeah, here, there, <wavy>north, west</wavy>. That's how you get
        through the <wavy>foggy seas</wavy>.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: My dad used to dance like this.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: There were six directions to that song. I don't really know what the
        other four are.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: You found my old man? Is he coming home?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].emoteOnStart
