      value: Mushroom
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[4].conditions.Array.data[0].item.name
      value: Mushroom
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: I been stuck all day cuz of this blimey <#2e44f0>anchor</color>! Nab
        it off me will ya?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: I be headin to the tavern to hear Bob's rumors about the <wavy>treasures</wavy>
        around here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: A magic wizard, sunken treasure, helpless fishermen, foggy seas, and
        the ancient Rumbling Rocks.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: These legends are for ME to claim, hear me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Ye using that <#2e44f0>anchor</color> well? Ye better be.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: I be headin to the tavern to hear Bob's rumors about the <wavy>treasures</wavy>
        around here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: A magic wizard, sunken treasure, helpless fishermen, foggy seas, and
        the ancient Rumbling Rocks.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[1].dialogueChain.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: These legends are for ME to claim, hear me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: I better get moving, eh? Where did my map go... Aha! Let's see...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: '"To enter The Veil, you must prevail..."'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: '"3 pairs of verses at the fog''s mouth, starting <wavy>West then South</wavy>..."'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[2].dialogueChain.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: Oi, this map ain't complete?! Where are the rest of the directions?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[3].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: What?! You got to The Veil? Was there good booty?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
