      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[0].dialogue
      value: Captain..? Are you still there?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[1].dialogue
      value: Someone's here! Have you seen Catbeard?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[2].dialogue
      value: We were going on a voyage to the Veil but... we got a bit turned around.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3652435011426292518, guid: eb8cd11432469439eb214403b87b5b92, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conds.Array.data[0].dialogueChain.Array.data[3].dialogue
      value: Can you tell him I'm still here? I don't have my license on me so I
        can't really leave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
